@lang en
IMPORT `lpa-exclusions`

-- Liberty personal accident rules, UW-PAG-W-001-10-V: general provision 13 (the claims
-- procedure, src 1476-1516), and the decision on a claim that assembles every module:
--   1. is the event covered?  `the reasons no benefit is payable on`
--   2. how much is payable?   `the decision on`
--   3. what must be done, by when?  general provision 13 here, 14 and 16 in their modules.

§ `13. The claims procedure`

§§ `The day of the insured event`

-- "Sự kiện bảo hiểm" (src 85-86) is the event on which the Company must pay. Fork F2: for the
-- death benefit it is the death; for the permanent injury benefit, the day permanence is
-- established (52 weeks after the accident for a partial injury, 104 for a total one); for
-- the other benefits, the accident. Read as the accident throughout, the one-year limit of
-- 13(a) would expire before a total permanent injury can exist (NOTES.md, Findings).
GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A DATE
`general provision 13: the day of the insured event for` b `in` c MEANS
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `benefit A.1, death` THEN
        CONSIDER c's `date of death`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `the accident day`
        WHEN JUST d  THEN d
    WHEN `benefit A.2, permanent injury` THEN
        CONSIDER c's `permanent injury`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `the accident day`
        WHEN JUST pi THEN
            IF   any (GIVEN i YIELD NOT (`a total permanent injury:` (i's `the injury`))) (pi's `items`)
            THEN `the accident day` PLUS `the days in 52 weeks`
            ELSE `the accident day` PLUS `the days in 104 weeks`
    OTHERWISE `the accident day`
    WHERE
        `the accident day` MEANS c's `the accident`'s `date of the accident`

§§ `13(a) Notice, forms and the claim file`

-- The insured must notify the Company in writing within thirty days of the Accident with full
-- details of any Injury that may lead to a claim, and must complete the prescribed forms and
-- return them within 30 days of the insured event, with the supporting evidence and the extent
-- of the loss. In every case the time for filing a claim file is one year from the insured
-- event. Days are calendar days; "within 30 days from day X" ends on day X + 30 (fork F35); one
-- year is the calendar year (`add years`).
-- src:1478 | a. Thông báo bồi thường
-- src:1479 | Người được bảo hiểm phải thông báo bằng văn bản cho Công ty trong vòng ba mươi (30) ngày
-- src:1480 | kể từ ngày xảy ra Tai nạn về toàn bộ chi tiết của bất kỳ Thương tật nào có thể dẫn đến yêu cầu
-- src:1481 | bồi thường theo Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này và phải điền thông tin vào các mẫu đơn theo quy định
-- src:1482 | và gửi lại cho Công ty trong vòng 30 ngày kể từ ngày sự kiện bảo hiểm xảy ra, kèm theo các bằng
-- src:1483 | chứng hỗ trợ cần thiết của sự kiện bảo hiểm đó, và mức độ tổn thất. Tất cả các giấy chứng nhận,
-- src:1484 | hoá đơn, biểu mẫu cần thiết, do Công ty cung cấp miễn phí, sẽ phải được điền đầy đủ theo quy
-- src:1485 | định của Công ty. Trong mọi trường hợp, thời hạn nộp hồ sơ yêu cầu bồi thường theo Hợp đồng
-- src:1486 | bảo hiểm là 01 năm kể từ ngày xảy ra sự kiện bảo hiểm.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 13(a): the days to give notice, and to return the forms` MEANS 30

GIVEN `the deadline` IS A DATE
      `the day`      IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`done, if at all, by` `the deadline` `: on` `the day` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the day`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST d  THEN d AT MOST `the deadline`

GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`general provision 13(a): the claim for` b `was made in time, in` c MEANS
        "notice within 30 days of the Accident" ...
            `done, if at all, by` (c's `the accident`'s `date of the accident` PLUS `general provision 13(a): the days to give notice, and to return the forms`) `: on` (c's `the procedure`'s `date written notice of the injury was given`)
    AND "forms within 30 days of the insured event" ...
            `done, if at all, by` (`the event` PLUS `general provision 13(a): the days to give notice, and to return the forms`) `: on` (c's `the procedure`'s `date the claim forms and supporting evidence were returned`)
    AND "the claim file within one year of the insured event" ...
            `done, if at all, by` (`add years` `the event` 1) `: on` (c's `the procedure`'s `date the claim file was submitted`)
    WHERE
        `the event` MEANS `general provision 13: the day of the insured event for` b `in` c

-- The same duties as obligations, on a clock of days. The notice runs from the Accident; the
-- forms from the insured event.
GIVETH A DEONTIC `An actor` `An act`
`general provision 13(a): the insured must give written notice of the injury` MEANS
    PARTY  `the insured`
    MUST   `give written notice of the injury`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the insured`
           BECAUSE "general provision 13(a) and (d): no written notice within 30 days of the Accident, so the claim is void"

GIVETH A DEONTIC `An actor` `An act`
`general provision 13(a): the insured must return the claim forms` MEANS
    PARTY  `the insured`
    MUST   `return the claim forms with supporting evidence`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the insured`
           BECAUSE "general provision 13(a) and (d): the claim forms were not returned within 30 days of the insured event, so the claim is void"

§§ `13(b) Treatment, and 13(c) the claim documents`

-- (b) The insured must use the services the treating Doctor directs, and must have had any
-- treatment the Doctor considers medically necessary.
-- src:1488 | b. Điều trị
-- src:1489 | Người được bảo hiểm phải sử dụng dịch vụ do Bác sĩ điều trị chỉ định, và Người được bảo hiểm
-- src:1490 | đã trải qua bất cứ sự điều trị nào mà Bác sĩ điều trị cho là Cần thiết về mặt y học.
-- (c) Every document, information and evidence is given in the original (a copy only with the
-- Company's consent), including but not limited to: the claim form; the accident report; the
-- injury certificate (permanent injury) and death certificate (death); proof of inheritance
-- (death, with no beneficiary designated); the Doctor's direction to rest or the social
-- insurance leave certificate (time off work for treatment); the medical treatment records;
-- the timesheet and labour contract; and other documents the Company asks for.
-- Fork F32: a document the list ties to no case is required for the benefit it evidences: the
-- treatment records for every benefit, the timesheet and labour contract for benefit B. The
-- open end ("các tài liệu khác khi Công ty yêu cầu") lets the Company add to the list with no
-- criteria (NOTES.md, Findings); a document so asked for is outside the record.
-- src:1492 | c. Hồ sơ yêu cầu bồi thường
-- src:1493 | Tất cả những chứng từ, thông tin và bằng chứng phải được cung cấp cho Công ty bản gốc (trường
-- src:1494 | hợp cung cấp bản sao phải có sự đồng ý của Công ty) bao gồm nhưng không giới hạn các chứng
-- src:1495 | từ sau:
-- src:1496 | - Đơn yêu cầu bồi thường được kê khai đầy đủ theo mẫu của Công ty, có chữ ký của người
-- src:1498 | UW-PAG-W-001-10-V Trang 25/27
-- src:1499 | yêu cầu (là Người được bảo hiểm/người thừa kế hợp pháp/người được ủy quyền hợp pháp
-- src:1500 | của Người được bảo hiểm), chữ ký và con dấu của Bên mua bảo hiểm là tổ chức (trừ khi có
-- src:1501 | thỏa thuận khác);
-- src:1502 | - Biên bản tai nạn;
-- src:1503 | - Giấy chứng nhận thương tích (trường hợp Thương tật vĩnh viễn), giấy chứng tử (trường hợp
-- src:1504 | Tử vong);
-- src:1505 | - Giấy xác nhận quyền thừa kế hợp pháp (trường hợp Tử vong và không có chỉ định Người thụ
-- src:1506 | hưởng trước đó);
-- src:1507 | - Chỉ định nghỉ của Bác sĩ điều trị, giấy nghỉ hưởng bảo hiểm xã hội (trường hợp Người được
-- src:1508 | bảo hiểm phải nghỉ việc để điều trị sau Tai nạn);
-- src:1509 | - Các chứng từ điều trị y tế (tóm tắt bệnh án, giấy ra viện, giấy chứng nhận phẫu thuật, toa
-- src:1510 | thuốc, các chỉ định và kết quả cận lâm sàng, bảng kê chi tiết chi phí điều trị, hóa đơn giá trị
-- src:1511 | gia tăng,…);
-- src:1512 | - Bảng chấm công, hợp đồng lao động/thỏa thuận lao động;
-- src:1513 | - Các tài liệu khác khi Công ty yêu cầu.
GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      `a beneficiary was designated` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `A claim document`
`general provision 13(c): the documents required for` b `, a beneficiary designated:` `a beneficiary was designated` MEANS
    append (LIST `the claim form, completed on the Company's form, signed by the claimant and signed and stamped by the policyholder`
               , `the accident report`
               , `the medical treatment records`)
           (CONSIDER b
            WHEN `benefit A.1, death` THEN
                IF `a beneficiary was designated`
                THEN LIST `the death certificate`
                ELSE LIST `the death certificate`, `the certificate of lawful inheritance`
            WHEN `benefit A.2, permanent injury` THEN LIST `the injury certificate`
            WHEN `benefit B, temporary injury` THEN
                LIST `the treating Doctor's direction to rest, or the social insurance sick-leave certificate`
                   , `the timesheet and the labour contract or agreement`
            OTHERWISE EMPTY)

GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`general provision 13(b)-(c): the procedure was followed for` b `, in` c MEANS
        c's `the procedure`'s `originals supplied, or copies the Company accepted`
    AND c's `the procedure`'s `the insured used the services the treating Doctor directed and had the treatment the Doctor considered medically necessary`
    AND all (GIVEN d YIELD elem d (c's `the procedure`'s `documents supplied`))
            (`general provision 13(c): the documents required for` b `, a beneficiary designated:` (c's `the facts`'s `a beneficiary was designated`))

§§ `13(d) Claims out of time or procedure are void`

-- src:1515 | d. Yêu cầu bồi thường không được thực hiện đúng thời gian và/hoặc các thủ tục quy định sẽ làm
-- src:1516 | mất hiệu lực của yêu cầu bồi thường và quyền lợi sẽ không được chi trả.
-- LAW: Law 08/2022/QH15 art 30 (aid line 706-714) gives one year from the insured event to file,
-- not counting force majeure, and from knowledge where the claimant did not know of the event;
-- art 19(3) (aid line 441-444) bars applying an exclusion for late notice caused by force
-- majeure. 13(d) voids a claim for any missed time, including the 30-day forms deadline. The
-- conflict is recorded (fork F39), not resolved: the encoding applies 13(d) as written.
GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`general provision 13(d): the claim for` b `is void, in` c MEANS
    NOT (    `general provision 13(a): the claim for` b `was made in time, in` c
         AND `general provision 13(b)-(c): the procedure was followed for` b `, in` c)

§ `The decision on a claim`

§§ `1. Is the event covered?`

GIVEN `the condition` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the reason`    IS A `A reason no benefit is payable`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reason no benefit is payable`
`the reason, if` `the condition` `:` `the reason` MEANS
    IF `the condition` THEN LIST `the reason` ELSE EMPTY

-- Each limb in the order the wording raises it: the insuring clause and the definitions, the
-- period and the end of cover (general provision 7), eligibility (general provision 3), the
-- exclusions, the conditions of special provisions 3, 4 and 8, the condition precedent of
-- 4(a)(i), fraud (5) and unnotified changes (6). The premium condition precedent of 4(a)(ii)
-- is applied in the amounts, under general provision 16B(b) (fork F31).
GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reason no benefit is payable`
`the reasons no benefit is payable on` c MEANS
    foldr append EMPTY (LIST
        `the reason, if` (NOT (`the limbs of the definition of an Accident, other than the period, are met, the sole-cause limb being` (`special provision 2: the Injury is treated as the sole cause of the death or permanent injury in` a) `, by` a))
            `:` `not an Accident as the wording defines it`
      , `the reason, if` (NOT (`the accident is within the period from` (`the first day of cover for` p `under` s `and` f) `to` (s's `last day of the period of insurance`) `:` a))
            `:` `the accident was not within the period of insurance`
      , `the reason, if` (NOT (`the insured's cover was in force on` (a's `date of the accident`) `, for` p `under` s `and` f))
            `:` `the insured's cover was not in force on the date of the accident`
      , `the reason, if` (NOT (a's `within the geographical area in the schedule`))
            `:` `the injury did not occur within the geographical area`
      , `the reason, if` (a's `the injury came from illness, gradual mental or physical wear, deterioration of health, age, disability or degeneration`)
            `:` `not an Injury as the wording defines it`
      , `the reason, if` (NOT (`general provision 3(c)-(d): the insured is eligible, under` s `, on` (a's `date of the accident`) `:` p))
            `:` `the insured is not eligible to be insured`
      , map (GIVEN e YIELD `excluded by` e) (`the exclusions that apply to` p `under` s `for` a)
      , `the reason, if` (any (GIVEN x YIELD `special provision 3 is not met by` x) (a's `circumstances`))
            `:` `special provision 3: the insured was complicit in or provoked the murder or assault`
      , `the reason, if` (any (GIVEN x YIELD `special provision 4 is not met by` x) (a's `circumstances`))
            `:` `special provision 4: the insured was not a ticketed passenger, or took part in or provoked the hijacking`
      , `the reason, if` (any (GIVEN x YIELD `special provision 8 is not met by` x) (a's `circumstances`))
            `:` `special provision 8: the motorcycle was over 150cc`
      , `the reason, if` (NOT (c's `the facts`'s `all statements and declarations in the application complete, true and accurate`))
            `:` `condition precedent 4(a)(i): the declarations were not complete, true and accurate`
      , `the reason, if` (c's `the facts`'s `the claim is false or fraudulent`)
            `:` `general provision 5: the claim is false or fraudulent`
      , `the reason, if` (c's `the facts`'s `the claim arises from a change the Company was not told of, or did not agree to cover`)
            `:` `general provision 6: the claim arises from a change the Company was not told of or did not accept`)
    WHERE
        a MEANS c's `the accident`
        p MEANS c's `the insured`
        s MEANS c's `the schedule`
        f MEANS c's `the cover facts`

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the event is covered:` c MEANS
    null (`the reasons no benefit is payable on` c)

§§ `2. How much is payable?`

-- Each benefit claimed is computed in lpa-benefits.l4; a benefit void under 13(d) pays nothing.
-- Then, in this order: limitation 1(b) between death and permanent injury; general provision
-- 16B(b) where the premium was not paid in full within the payment period (each benefit at
-- most 0,1% of its limit, fork F31); and limitation 1(c) on the total.

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A benefit`
`the benefits claimed in` c MEANS
    foldr append EMPTY (LIST
        `if claimed` (isJust (c's `date of death`))           `benefit A.1, death`
      , `if claimed` (isJust (c's `permanent injury`))        `benefit A.2, permanent injury`
      , `if claimed` (isJust (c's `temporary injury`))        `benefit B, temporary injury`
      , `if claimed` (isJust (c's `medical expenses`))        `benefit C, medical expenses`
      , `if claimed` (isJust (c's `hospital allowance`))      `benefit D, hospital allowance`)
    WHERE
        `if claimed` claimed b MEANS IF claimed THEN LIST b ELSE EMPTY

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A benefit`
`the benefits void under general provision 13(d) in` c MEANS
    filter (GIVEN b YIELD `general provision 13(d): the claim for` b `is void, in` c) (`the benefits claimed in` c)

-- What one benefit pays before limitations 1(b) and 1(c): nothing if the event is not covered
-- or the benefit is void; otherwise the benefit's own computation, capped under 16B(b) if the
-- premium was not paid within the payment period.
GIVEN b IS A `A benefit`
      c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount of` b `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)` MEANS
    IF   `the event is covered:` c
     AND NOT (elem b (`the benefits void under general provision 13(d) in` c))
    THEN `the 16B(b) cap applied to` `the gross amount`
    ELSE 0
    WHERE
        a MEANS c's `the accident`
        s MEANS c's `the schedule`
        `the gross amount` MEANS
            CONSIDER b
            WHEN `benefit A.1, death` THEN
                `benefit A.1, the death benefit, for` a `under` s `on death on` (c's `date of death`) `, the Injury the sole cause:` (`special provision 2: the Injury is treated as the sole cause of the death or permanent injury in` a)
            WHEN `benefit A.2, permanent injury` THEN
                CONSIDER c's `permanent injury`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
                WHEN JUST pi THEN `benefit A.2, the permanent injury benefit, for` a `under` s `on the assessment` pi `, left-handedness` (c's `the insured`'s `left-handed`)
            WHEN `benefit B, temporary injury` THEN
                CONSIDER c's `temporary injury`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
                WHEN JUST t  THEN `benefit B, the temporary injury benefit, under` s `for` t
            WHEN `benefit C, medical expenses` THEN
                CONSIDER c's `medical expenses`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
                WHEN JUST m  THEN `benefit C, the medical expense benefit, for` a `under` s `on` m
            WHEN `benefit D, hospital allowance` THEN
                CONSIDER c's `hospital allowance`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
                WHEN JUST h  THEN `benefit D, the hospital allowance, for` a `under` s `on` h
        `the limit for the benefit` MEANS
            CONSIDER b
            WHEN `benefit A.1, death` THEN `the limit chosen, or nothing if the benefit was not chosen:` (s's `death limit`)
            WHEN `benefit A.2, permanent injury` THEN `the limit chosen, or nothing if the benefit was not chosen:` (s's `permanent injury limit`)
            WHEN `benefit B, temporary injury` THEN
                CONSIDER s's `temporary injury benefit`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
                WHEN JUST tb THEN tb's `limit`
            WHEN `benefit C, medical expenses` THEN `the limit chosen, or nothing if the benefit was not chosen:` (s's `medical expense limit`)
            WHEN `benefit D, hospital allowance` THEN `the limit chosen, or nothing if the benefit was not chosen:` (s's `daily hospital allowance`)
        `the 16B(b) cap applied to` x MEANS
            IF c's `the cover facts`'s `premium for the insured paid in full within the payment period`
            THEN x
            ELSE min x (`general provision 16B(b): the most paid on a claim, the programme limit being` `the limit for the benefit` `and the summary limit` `the limit for the benefit`)

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A `The decision on a claim`
`the decision on` c MEANS
    `The decision on a claim` WITH
        `reasons no benefit is payable`                 IS `the reasons no benefit is payable on` c
        `benefits void under general provision 13(d)`  IS `the benefits void under general provision 13(d) in` c
        `death benefit`                                 IS `the death benefit after limitation 1(b)`
        `permanent injury benefit`                      IS `the permanent injury amount`
        `temporary injury benefit`                      IS `the amount of` `benefit B, temporary injury` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`
        `medical expense benefit`                       IS `the amount of` `benefit C, medical expenses` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`
        `hospital allowance`                            IS `the amount of` `benefit D, hospital allowance` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`
        `total payable`                                 IS
            `limitation 1(c): the benefits payable in the period, under` (c's `the schedule`) `, from`
                (sum (LIST `the death benefit after limitation 1(b)`
                         , `the permanent injury amount`
                         , `the amount of` `benefit B, temporary injury` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`
                         , `the amount of` `benefit C, medical expenses` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`
                         , `the amount of` `benefit D, hospital allowance` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`))
    WHERE
        `the permanent injury amount` MEANS
            `the amount of` `benefit A.2, permanent injury` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`
        `the death benefit after limitation 1(b)` MEANS
            CONSIDER c's `date of death`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
            WHEN JUST d  THEN
                `limitation 1(b): the death benefit payable, given` (`the amount of` `benefit A.1, death` `on` c `, before limitations 1(b) and 1(c)`)
                    `and a permanent injury benefit of` `the permanent injury amount`
                    `paid for an injury on` (c's `the accident`'s `date of the accident`)
                    `, death on` d

-- Who is paid (the preamble, with general provision 3(e)).
GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
      `the insured authorised the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A payee`
`who is paid on` c `, the insured having authorised the policyholder:` `the insured authorised the policyholder` MEANS
    `the preamble: who is paid` WITH
        `the insured has died`                     IS isJust (c's `date of death`)
        `a beneficiary was designated`             IS c's `the facts`'s `a beneficiary was designated`
        `the insured authorised the policyholder`  IS `the insured authorised the policyholder`
